Package: exploreDE
Type: Package
Title: exploreDE
Version: 3.10.0
Authors@R:
  person("Peter", "Leary", email = "peter.leary@uzh.ch", role = c("aut", "cre"),
         comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-1430-6185"))
Description: A Shiny application to help users explore and enjoy their 'omics
  data, and make publication-quality figures. It shows differential expression
  results from RNA-seq, proteomics and CRISPR screens as ordination plots,
  heatmaps, volcano plots, box plots, GO and KEGG pathway views, and ORA and
  GSEA tables. The app reads AnnData ('.h5ad') files in the exploreDE/1.0
  layout, which build_explore_h5ad() writes from counts, sample tables, DE
  tables and enrichment results, and the SummarizedExperiment results of the
  FGCZ SUSHI and prolfqua pipelines. App settings are saved and restored as
  JSON session files.
